;Cesaroni Technology J360 extracted from OpenRocket 24.12 bundled initial_motors.db
;source: db table motors/thrust_curves/thrust_data, motor_id=484, curve_id=554
; lookup key must exactly match MOTOR_DATABASE's designation string in
; rocket_forge.py -- was "J360_CTI" here, but MOTOR_DATABASE (and the real
; OpenRocket catalog, confirmed via a working saved reference .ork's own
; <designation>J360</designation>) both say "J360". This mismatch meant
; organic_loop.py's _eng_designations() never found this file, so J360
; (a legal main motor per every mission's motor_pool) was silently
; reassigned to a random different motor by prepare_ast_for_rust on every
; single candidate that picked it -- confirmed live via a 2026-07-24
; reconstruction attempt of the historical 839k-scoring reference design,
; which uses this exact motor.
